# Agent noise list (Cursor index + search). Kept in sync with .ignore (ripgrep, used by
# Codex / Claude Code / Cursor search) and .claude/settings.json deny list. See AGENTS.md.
# Files here are still readable on purpose by explicit path; they are just not indexed/scanned.

